            <ArticleTitle>First total synthesis of a new phenylpropanoid glycoside: natural cytotoxic compound from Cirsium japonicum.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1080/10286020.2017.1379511</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Phenylpropanoid glycoside compound 1, the natural anti-tumor compound isolated from the erial parts of Cirsium japonicum, was first totally synthesized using easily available materials in short, convenient route with overall yield of 13.9%.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
